          "text": "EXLLAMA_NOCOMPILE=1 suppresses setup-time native compilation because setup.py tests the variable's presence, not its numeric value. Without that variable, available torch enables CUDAExtension and BuildExtension; without torch, setup prints a warning and omits those extension settings.",
